WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Speaker 1: All right. So Tara Reid, who accused&nbsp;
Joe Biden of sexual assault, claiming the incident&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:14.760
took place in 1993, tried to derail his 2020&nbsp;
presidential campaign. She has defected to Russia.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:23.700
What the hell is going on here? The Guardian&nbsp;
reporting former Senate staffer who made claim in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:32.040
2020 appears on Russian media alongside convicted&nbsp;
Russian agent in the United States, Maria Butina.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:39.360
I'm still kind of in a daze, but I feel very good,&nbsp;
Reid told Sputnik, the Russian press outlet that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:44.580
supports Putin while sitting with Maria Butina,&nbsp;
a convicted Russian agent jailed in the U.S.,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:49.920
but now a member of parliament in Russia. I feel&nbsp;
very surrounded by protection and safety. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:54.960
59, Reade was a staffer for Biden when he was&nbsp;
a senator from Delaware in 2020. She said that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:00.060
back in 93, in a Senate hallway, he pushed her&nbsp;
against the wall and assaulted her. Biden denied&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:05.220
it. At her press appearance, Reid was described&nbsp;
as a writer and publicist, former aide to Joe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:11.820
Biden. Butina sitting next to Butina, Reid said, I&nbsp;
just really so appreciate Maria and everyone who's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:16.080
been giving me protection at a time when it's&nbsp;
been very difficult to know if I'm safe or not.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:20.580
I just didn't want to walk home and walk into&nbsp;
a cage or be killed, which is basically my two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:25.980
choices. So she has indeed defected to Russia.&nbsp;
She says it was difficult. She's not impulsive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:34.260
She takes her time. And what she could see was&nbsp;
that, I guess with the 24 election gearing up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:39.360
she's better off in Russia being safe. She&nbsp;
wants to live in both places, but she may&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:45.780
only live in Russia and that's okay. So I want&nbsp;
to talk about this for a very specific reason.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:51.420
Some on the right back when Tara Reid&nbsp;
made these allegations against Joe Biden,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:57.240
some on the right called the left out as&nbsp;
hypocrites. And what those on the right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.240 --> 00:02:03.420
said to those on the left was, Listen. On the&nbsp;
one hand, you leftists say we should believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:09.000
all women and then Tara Reid comes forward and&nbsp;
forward and says, Biden assaulted me and you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:17.400
don't believe Tara Reid. And so it's important&nbsp;
to understand that believe all women in principle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:27.000
doesn't mean you blindly, indefinitely believe&nbsp;
every single allegation. And this has always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:34.140
been the case. This was what I said when Justice&nbsp;
Kavanaugh was accused. This was what I've always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:42.600
said. The right wing wants to use Tara Reid's&nbsp;
allegations to say that Democrats and leftists&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:49.560
actually have a double standard on me to and that&nbsp;
it's actually just a political tool me to believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:55.680
all women if the accused is a Republican. But&nbsp;
if it's Joe Biden, suddenly you don't believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.680 --> 00:03:03.060
all women. And this couldn't be further from&nbsp;
reality. Believe all women has always meant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:11.040
if an alleged victim comes forward, you take that&nbsp;
seriously. You understand that any time a victim&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:19.500
comes forward to say I was victimized, there is&nbsp;
risk to them and that they could be pushed one way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:24.720
or the other or stigmatized all these different&nbsp;
things. And regardless of political affiliation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:33.600
you investigate. That doesn't mean that every&nbsp;
allegation is automatically true or that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:41.760
allegations are free from scrutiny. It means&nbsp;
every accuser should be heard and respected and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:47.940
held accountable for the truth and consistency&nbsp;
of their claims. Tara Reid's claims were not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:55.140
consistent and they did not appear to be true.&nbsp;
After significant investigation, believe all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.140 --> 00:04:03.480
women. Isn't the slogan that says you must have&nbsp;
unending blind faith? Period. It is a call to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:11.220
deal with systemic sexism and misogyny, the sort&nbsp;
of stigma and circumstances that historically have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:17.700
silenced and dismissed women who have experienced&nbsp;
sexual violence. It means we want justice. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:23.100
want accountability for the perpetrators of such&nbsp;
crimes, including those who have often escaped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:28.140
punishment because they were in positions of power&nbsp;
or privilege. We recognize women are more likely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:35.280
to be victims than they are liars when it comes to&nbsp;
sexual assault. False claims of sexual assault and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:41.340
rape are quite rare, and when they happen, they&nbsp;
should be dealt with seriously. None of this is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:46.260
new. Go back two years. Go back five years. Go&nbsp;
back ten years. This is what I have been saying.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:54.240
And when you looked at the Tara Reid situation,&nbsp;
she made an allegation. And as far as I recall,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:59.820
certainly we took it very seriously. Okay. Joe&nbsp;
Biden denied it. Fine. Many times perpetrators&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:05.760
deny things. Joe Biden also has a long record of&nbsp;
supporting women's rights and combatting sexual&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:11.700
violence. In contrast to Trump with his dozens&nbsp;
of accusations against him, who doesn't have that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:18.420
record? Joe Biden said, I will cooperate with any&nbsp;
investigation. I will release all relevant records&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:24.480
related to Tara Reade. Donald Trump did not do&nbsp;
that, and the contrast couldn't be more glaring.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:31.500
So what we need to understand is that these right&nbsp;
wingers are desperate to call the Tara Reid story.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:39.240
A story of hypocrisy, because on some level they&nbsp;
must realize that when we say believe all women,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:45.720
we're not saying unquestionably accept all&nbsp;
allegations with no scrutiny. It's a reminder&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:54.240
that we take allegations seriously. We support the&nbsp;
survivors. We conduct thorough investigations. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.240 --> 00:06:00.900
ascertain the truth. And I can't think of any case&nbsp;
that better encapsulates that than the Tara Reid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:08.880
situation. And now that she has been praising&nbsp;
Putin and has defected to Russia. In my mind,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:14.880
it only raises even more doubts about her&nbsp;
motivations and her agenda and her allegiances.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:21.480
So there it is, sort of like the cherry on&nbsp;
top. Tara Reid has now defected to Russia.

